actions.effect:
Up to **once per round**, the Enraged Maid can spend an action and **10 Mind Points** to perform a **free attack** with **Bash Bash~☆ Whopping Slam!** on a random target;
If the attack hits, it deals no damage and instead steals up to **2 Inventory Points** from the target to summon up to 2 Furniture; 
*(Construct - Soldier - Lv.5 - or refer to the relevant sheet for an example)* - a maximum of **two (2)** furnishings can exist simultaneously per scene.

special.effect:
The Enraged Maid begins the encounter accompanied with 2 allied Furniture.
 
Depending on quantity of Furniture existing in the scene, she gains the following effects:
 • **0 Furniture** - The Enraged Maid is considered **vulnerable** to **physical** damage;
 • **1 Furniture** - The Enraged Maid's **MIG** die is increased by one size;
 • **2 Furniture** - The Enraged Maid's **WLP** die is increased by one size and she's considered **immune** to **physical** damage;

notes.effect:
The Enraged Maid should spend her very first action to attempt summoning two furniture. 


**Repair Furniture** should be used either on her first or her last action for the round (in case she's scaled to Champion or greater rank);

If necessary, scale her to Champion or a greater rank to give her more actions and ensure the **0 Furniture** effect isn't permanently active due to a number advantage.
